 "text": "Hello! How was your day? Sure! I been listening to The History Buffet podcast. It's a great history podcast that covers a wide range of topics. Yes, they have a lot of episodes about ancient Rome. They cover everything from the founding of Rome to the Roman Empire. Yes, the podcast is very dry, which is good because it allows you to focus on the information. They cover everything in a clear and concise manner. Yes, they also have shorter podcasts like The Curious Cases of Rachael Bloom. It' a great podcast for learning about different historical events and figures. You' welcome! I hope you enjoy the podcasts as much as I do.",
